@startuml offering-authority-escalation-boundary
title Offering Authority Escalation Boundary ; per ADR-ES-018 §5 + §9

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Offering" as AO
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraints" as Con
class "Escalation" as Esc

AO --> Auth : operates-within
AO --> Pol : governed-by
AO --> Con : constrained-by
AO --> Esc : escalates-to

note bottom of AO
  Per ADR-ES-018 §5 + §9, agentic behavior is bounded
  by authority, policy, constraints. Escalation is
  first-class. Human participation remains valid.
end note

@enduml
